atform includes tools for documenting findings, managing escalations, and ensuring audit readiness."},"63":{"id":"/docs/ui-38","page_id":"/docs/ui","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui#how-do-you-investigate-and-report","content":"Pick one integration path in Getting Started — REST API, JavaScript agent, or an e-commerce plugin — then switch on the products from the table above one at a time."},"64":{"id":"/docs/ui/test","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"page","content":"Components","url":"/docs/ui/test"},"65":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-0","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test","content":"Components"},"66":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-1","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/test#grid","content":"Grid"},"67":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-2","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/test#accordion","content":"Accordion"},"68":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-3","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/test#steps","content":"Steps"},"69":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-4","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/test#tabs","content":"Tabs"},"70":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-5","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/test#code-block","content":"Code Block"},"71":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-6","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/test#cards","content":"Cards"},"72":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-7","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test","content":"you are documentation engineer, use fumadoc, use mdx, use fumadoc components. rewrite this documentation, make it more clear for end user. dont use same sencentes."},"73":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-8","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test","content":"The growth of the Internet and its usage leaves a trace of simple, easily accessible information about almost every internet user – a trace that we label “digital footprints”"},"74":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-9","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test","content":"Digital footprints are also left behind when people are registering, accessing or using your digital products. Trustfull is a cloud-based platform that analyses the information content of such digital footprints, to almost instantaneously evaluate the quality and reliability of your online customers."},"75":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-10","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test","content":"Our platform examines hundreds of digital footprints arising from user's\nPhone Number, Email Address, IP Address, Device, and Browser Data\nInformation about these digital signals can be retrieved separately or combined together to understand the combined score of the compiled Onboarding Solution"},"76":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-11","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test#accordion","content":"Based on\nRadix UI Accordion, useful for FAQ\nsections."},"77":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-12","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test#accordion","content":"Code:"},"78":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-13","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test#steps","content":"Login to dashboard"},"79":{"id":"/docs/ui/test-14","page_id":"/docs/ui/test","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/test#steps","content":"Go to Aml > Entities"},"80":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"page","content":"ChatGPT","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt"},"81":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-0","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","content":"Connect Ambriel to ChatGPT via MCP: query fraud scores, run AML screens and investigate alerts conversationally inside chat."},"82":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-1","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#chatgpt","content":"ChatGPT"},"83":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-2","page_id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt","type":"heading","url":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt#setup","content":"Setup"},"84":{"id":"/docs/ui/agents/chatgpt-3","p