s/ui/kyb/strategies-36","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#kyb-risk-scoring-strategies","content":"Think of it this way: each rule is like a red flag detector. When a flag is raised, the scoring strategy decides how serious it is and how it affects the overall risk picture."},"767":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-37","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#how-rules-work","content":"Each rule evaluates a specific risk factor and has three components:"},"768":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-38","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#how-rules-work","content":"Impact: How severe would this risk be if it materialized? (1 = Minor issue, 5 = Critical threat)"},"769":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-39","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#how-rules-work","content":"Likelihood: How probable is this risk in practice? (1 = Rare, 5 = Very common)"},"770":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-40","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#how-rules-work","content":"Weight: How important is this rule category to your business? (typically 1, but adjustable)"},"771":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-41","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#how-rules-work","content":"When a rule triggers, its score is calculated as:"},"772":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-42","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#risk-matrix-reference","content":"This 5×5 matrix shows how Impact and Likelihood combine into risk classifications:"},"773":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-43","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#risk-matrix-reference","content":"Impact \\ Likelihood"},"774":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-44","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/stra